      "text": "评分边界：分词 ≠ 倒排索引 ≠ BM25。RAGFlow 的 *_ltks 沿用默认 BM25；*_tks 使用 scripted_sim。",
      "originalText": "评分边界：分词 ≠ 倒排索引 ≠ BM25。RAGFlow 的 *_ltks 沿用默认 BM25；*_tks 使用 scripted_sim。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "85a50930dfda4163",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2164,
      "width": 1183.0,
      "height": 25.2,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#526175",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "56b9108594e84314",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1816,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 478,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790602727485,
      "created": 1790602727485,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "路径差异：普通 Python 入库可用 questions 替代正文作主向量输入；Pipeline 无任何向量时另有 fallback。两者均不是上述 Tokenizer 默认规则。",
      "originalText": "路径差异：普通 Python 入库可用 questions 替代正文作主向量输入；Pipeline 无任何向量时另有 fallback。两者均不是上述 Tokenizer 默认规则。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
