      "created": 1790602727485,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "② 编码输入与查询字段一起审",
      "originalText": "② 编码输入与查询字段一起审",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "2c10ab86b64c4ec5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 795,
      "y": 3278,
      "width": 490.0,
      "height": 117.6,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "360109d25ff24b58"
      ],
      "frameId": "912a0de31ef14e1b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1845,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 507,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790602727485,
      "created": 1790602727485,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "明确每个字段进入哪条检索路径。\n两路 Dense 的输入、模型空间分别定义。\n不照搬 RAGFlow 的 summary / questions 优先级。\n也不照搬全文条件限制 KNN 的查询策略。",
      "originalText": "明确每个字段进入哪条检索路径。\n两路 Dense 的输入、模型空间分别定义。\n不照搬 RAGFlow 的 summary / questions 优先级。\n也不照搬全文条件限制 KNN 的查询策略。",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
